    {
      "id": "claim_f96acbe6cc9b40c9838592fcb744e43f",
      "statement": "Extractor.extract runs a fixed pipeline: _validate_dependencies (LLM required; loader required unless vision; response model must be BaseModel/Contract subclass), loader resolution, _map_to_universal_format normalization, then _extract, with CompletionStrategy.FORBIDDEN as the default.",
