    {
      "id": "claim_070630c962784d65897248cac1cdfe00",
      "statement": "_map_to_universal_format reduces every loader output to {\"content\": str, \"images\": List[bytes], \"metadata\": dict}: a list of loader pages is joined with blank-line separators and records metadata.num_pages, while image bytes are collected only when vision=True.",
